# 🚀 OVERVIEW
# AutoYou2Face automatically fetches your latest YouTube video and posts 
# it directly to your Facebook Page every 30 minutes via GitHub Actions.
#
# =====================================================================
# 📋 STEP 1: OBTAIN YOUR 4 SECRET KEYS
# =====================================================================
#
# 🔑 1. YOUTUBE_API_KEY
#    1. Go to the Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com
#    2. Create a new project or select an existing one.
#    3. Navigate to "APIs & Services" > "Library".
#    4. Search for "YouTube Data API v3" and click "Enable".
#    5. Go to "APIs & Services" > "Credentials".
#    6. Click "Create Credentials" > "API key".
#    7. Copy your generated API key.
#
# 🔑 2. YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID
#    1. Log in to your YouTube account.
#    2. Go to Advanced Settings: https://www.youtube.com/account_advanced
#    3. Copy the value listed under "Channel ID" (format: UCxxxxxxxxxxxx).
#
# 🔑 3. META_ACCESS_TOKEN (Facebook Page Access Token)
#    1. Go to Meta Graph API Explorer: https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer
#    2. Select your Meta Application and target Facebook Page.
#    3. Under "Permissions", add the following permissions:
#       - pages_read_engagement
#       - pages_show_list
#       - pages_manage_posts
#    4. Click "Generate Access Token" and accept the permission prompts.
#    5. (Recommended) Convert this temporary token into a Long-Lived Token 
#       using the Meta Access Token Tool to prevent weekly expirations.
#
# 🔑 4. FB_PAGE_ID
#    1. Go to your Facebook Page.
#    2. Navigate to the "About" section > "Page information" (or check your URL).
#    3. Copy the numerical ID of your page (e.g., 100123456789).
#
# =====================================================================
# ⚙️ STEP 2: CONFIGURE GITHUB ACTIONS (AUTOMATED EXECUTION)
# =====================================================================
#
# 1. Fork or push this repository to your personal GitHub account.
# 2. Open your repository on GitHub.
# 3. Go to "Settings" > "Secrets and variables" > "Actions".
# 4. Click "New repository secret" and add the following 4 secrets:
#
#    Name: YOUTUBE_API_KEY      | Value: <your_youtube_api_key>
#    Name: YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID   | Value: <your_channel_id>
#    Name: META_ACCESS_TOKEN    | Value: <your_facebook_page_token>
#    Name: FB_PAGE_ID           | Value: <your_facebook_page_id>
#
# 5. Enable Write Permissions for GitHub Actions:
#    - Go to "Settings" > "Actions" > "General".
#    - Scroll down to "Workflow permissions".
#    - Select "Read and write permissions".
#    - Click "Save".
#
# 6. Enable the Workflow:
#    - Click on the "Actions" tab in your repository.
#    - Click "AutoYou2Face Publisher" and click "Run workflow" to test it.
#    - The script will now run automatically every 30 minutes!
#
# =====================================================================
# 💻 LOCAL EXECUTION CONFIGURATION (OPTIONAL)
# =====================================================================
# If running locally on your computer instead of GitHub Actions, rename 
# this file to "config.txt" and fill in your credentials below:

YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID=
META_ACCESS_TOKEN=
FB_PAGE_ID=
